fluxecho.research.node.anchor=Anchoring
fluxecho.research.node.anchor.desc=The nexus pins down a little of the flux layer where the team's echoes run thickest. Done by itself the first time a nexus forms. Opens the manifestation table.
fluxecho.research.node.inner_ring=Inner Ring
fluxecho.research.node.inner_ring.desc=Draws eight sites round the nexus (three hall sites, four diagonal pavilion sites and the gate). A phase I campus opens the 3 hall sites among them, and builds every researched hall on a free one.
fluxecho.research.node.phase_2=Phase II
fluxecho.research.node.phase_2.desc=The nexus grows another floating ring: all 8 ring sites open, every researched building is offered on a free site of its family, and the zenith opens for the Echo Dome.
fluxecho.research.node.echo_crystal=Echo Crystallization
fluxecho.research.node.echo_crystal.desc=The table learns to press a codex entry into a flux crystal: an echo crystal. Entries are kept and press once a day each, so the more you have done, the faster they come.
fluxecho.research.node.library=Echo Library
fluxecho.research.node.library.desc=The codex made real: a library that keeps samples and lends them, the first module. Opens manifesting its core and index cards.
fluxecho.research.node.library_reach=Lending Across Worlds
fluxecho.research.node.library_reach.desc=The library lends its samples to echo machines in other dimensions too.
fluxecho.research.node.eco_dome=Eco Dome
fluxecho.research.node.eco_dome.desc=A greenhouse of the flux layer: a glass dome with floating gardens whose planters keep the team's living samples. Opens manifesting its core.
fluxecho.research.node.compute_1=Compute Calibration
fluxecho.research.node.compute_1.desc=The nexus makes 50% more compute.
fluxecho.research.node.upkeep_1=Throttling
fluxecho.research.node.upkeep_1.desc=The nexus's upkeep drops by 25%.
fluxecho.research.node.tidal_well=Tidal Well
fluxecho.research.node.tidal_well.desc=The first generator, at the root: the flux layer's tide welling up a shaft.
fluxecho.research.node.grit_yield=Grit Enrichment
fluxecho.research.node.grit_yield.desc=The team's shard collectors give off 50% more flux grit.
fluxecho.research.node.dome=Echo Dome
fluxecho.research.node.dome.desc=A shield over the base from the zenith: no spawns, no explosions, no projectiles.
fluxecho.research.node.arcane_court=Arcane Court
fluxecho.research.node.arcane_court.desc=The first pavilion on the diagonals: an octagonal arcane hall under a spire whose infusion circle, cauldrons, aspect pillars and desks keep the team's thaumic samples. Opens manifesting its core.
fluxecho.research.node.blood_covenant=Blood Covenant Altar
fluxecho.research.node.blood_covenant.desc=A pavilion on the diagonals: a red rotunda stepped in three tiers round an open oculus, whose orb cradles and ritual stones keep the team's blood magic samples. Opens manifesting its core.
fluxecho.research.node.hunting_ground=Echo Hunting Ground
fluxecho.research.node.hunting_ground.desc=A pavilion on the diagonals: an open amphitheatre round a holo arena, whose imprint consoles keep the team's mob imprints. Opens manifesting its core.
fluxecho.research.node.mana_fountain=Mana Fountain Array
fluxecho.research.node.mana_fountain.desc=A pavilion on the diagonals: a cloister round a court of fountains and a magic circle, whose fountains and flower urns keep the team's Botania samples. Opens manifesting its core.
fluxecho.research.node.resonance_gate=Resonance Gate
fluxecho.research.node.resonance_gate.desc=The gatehouse on the gate site: two wing towers either side of the gate road joined by a bridge, whose resonance chamber's six resonator columns and the wings' four tuning racks keep the team's samples. Opens manifesting its core.
fluxecho.research.node.dual_foil_vault=Dual-foil Vault
fluxecho.research.node.dual_foil_vault.desc=The third hall: a windowless monolith whose whole front is one giant canvas; inside, a gallery whose 42 canvases and the foil on its back wall keep the team's items, one kind each. Opens manifesting its core.
fluxecho.research.node.phase_3=Phase III
fluxecho.research.node.phase_3.desc=The nexus grows a whole third stage: sixteen frame pillars, conduits, a crystal seat and a third floating ring. Phase III opens the outer ring: once it is researched the campus grades the ground beyond the halls, and four outer diagonal sites take the Sophon Array and the Holo Sand Table.
fluxecho.research.node.outer_ring=Outer Ring
fluxecho.research.node.outer_ring.desc=The city grows past the halls: the nexus grades a ring round the inner city, paves the four streets of the nine squares, the outer promenade, the avenues and the outer gate, and opens the four outer diagonal sites.
fluxecho.research.node.sophon_array=Sophon Array
fluxecho.research.node.sophon_array.desc=An outer diagonal building: a lattice sphere on a podium round a point of light, whose data hall's 48 racks keep the team's samples, three each. Opens manifesting its core, and manifest matter on a nexus of phase III or later.
fluxecho.research.node.holo_table=Holo Sand Table
fluxecho.research.node.holo_table.desc=An outer diagonal building: a rotunda round a sand table where the whole base turns as a hologram; the table takes 9 samples and its nine consoles keep nothing (layers come in a later version). Opens manifesting its core.
fluxecho.research.node.phase_4=Phase IV
fluxecho.research.node.phase_4.desc=The nexus grows a fourth stage: sixteen frame pillars, conduits, a crystal seat and a fourth floating ring. Phase IV opens the sky and the depths: once the sky ring is researched the Echo Dome Generator's pod is released from its legs and floats, and four sky platforms take the sky ring's buildings; the Deep Root grows under the Tidal Well.
fluxecho.research.node.sky_ring=Sky Ring
fluxecho.research.node.sky_ring.desc=The pod over the nexus lets go of its legs and floats; four floating platforms round it, each reached from the pod's doors by a catwalk, take the Weather Station, the Sky Sail Array, the Observatory and the Droplet Hangar. Opens manifesting the anti-gravity lattice their floating foundations are made of.
fluxecho.research.node.weather_station=Weather Station
fluxecho.research.node.weather_station.desc=A building on a sky platform: an instrument hut and a weather mast whose vanes turn under a slowly churning cloud; its four weather consoles keep the team's samples. Opens manifesting its core.
fluxecho.research.node.sky_sails=Sky Sail Array
fluxecho.research.node.sky_sails.desc=A building on a sky platform: a bridge cabin and six masts in three pairs, three huge sails of light spread between them and turned toward the sun; each mast keeps a sail. Opens manifesting its core.
fluxecho.research.node.observatory=Observatory
fluxecho.research.node.observatory.desc=A building on a sky platform: an observing room under a stepped dome with a meridian slit, a telescope inside and a ring lens floating over the dome; its seven lens cases keep the team's samples. Opens manifesting its core.
fluxecho.research.node.droplet_hangar=Droplet Hangar
fluxecho.research.node.droplet_hangar.desc=A building on a sky platform: eight cradles round a control kiosk, a mirror droplet hovering over each; each cradle keeps a droplet. Opens manifesting its core.
fluxecho.research.node.deep_root=Deep Root
fluxecho.research.node.deep_root.desc=The root's second shape: the nexus deepens the standing Tidal Well, with a chamber dug under it where the ground has room and in the well itself where it has not; root conduits flowing with light and eight root bays wait for the harvesters and pumps that will join the nexus.
